flowchart TD
  A["1. User submits Python code<br/>(snippet or file)"] --> B{"2. Code parses?<br/>(syntax check)"}
  B -- "No" --> R1["Report syntax error<br/>and ask for correction"]
  B -- "Yes" --> C["3. Static analysis<br/>(lint, types, security, AST)"]
  C --> D["4. Fault localisation<br/>(rank suspicious locations)"]
  D --> E{"Actionable defect<br/>found?"}
  E -- "No" --> R2["Report: no defect<br/>identified by the system"]
  E -- "Yes" --> F["7. Generate unit tests<br/>(expected and edge cases)"]
  F --> G["8a. Run tests on original code<br/>in sandbox (baseline)"]
  G --> H["5-6. LLM explains the defect and<br/>proposes a candidate patch"]
  H --> I["Apply patch to a copy;<br/>syntax and static re-check"]
  I --> J["8b. Run tests on patched code<br/>(repeat runs to detect flakiness)"]
  J --> K["9. Compare with baseline<br/>and any existing tests"]
  K --> L{"Validation<br/>passed?"}
  L -- "Yes" --> M["10. Present original, patch, tests<br/>and results with verdict:<br/>plausible, not proven correct"]
  L -- "No" --> N{"Attempts left?"}
  N -- "Yes" --> P["Feed failing output<br/>back to the LLM"]
  P -.-> H
  N -- "No" --> Q["Reject patch or<br/>request human review"]
  M --> U["User reviews and decides<br/>(accept or reject)"]
  Q --> U
